      "audio": "voices/ban-tra-loi-duoc-may-cau/muw6ze0034o/line-46.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "C. Who is the train?",
      "startMs": 137793,
      "endMs": 139713,
      "audio": "voices/ban-tra-loi-duoc-may-cau/muw6ze0034o/line-47.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Đáp án là B. What time does the train leave?",
      "startMs": 142713,
      "endMs": 145593,
      "audio": "voices/ban-tra-loi-duoc-may-cau/muw6ze0034o/line-48.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nhân viên quán cà phê hỏi “HOT OR ICED?”",
      "startMs": 146643,
      "endMs": 149603,
      "audio": "voices/ban-tra-loi-duoc-may-cau/muw6ze0034o/line-49.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Câu này có nghĩa là gì?",
      "startMs": 150253,
      "endMs": 151933,
      "audio": "voices/ban-tra-loi-duoc-may-cau/muw6ze0034o/line-50.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "A. Hot or cold?",
      "startMs": 152583,
      "endMs": 154183,
      "audio": "voices/ban-tra-loi-duoc-may-cau/muw6ze0034o/line-51.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "B. Big or small?",
