      "endMs": 156593,
      "audio": "voices/ban-tra-loi-duoc-may-cau/muw6ze0034o/line-52.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "C. Sweet or salty?",
      "startMs": 157243,
      "endMs": 159083,
      "audio": "voices/ban-tra-loi-duoc-may-cau/muw6ze0034o/line-53.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Đáp án là A. Hot or cold?",
